                    "#Get feedback from your baby about whether they need to burp. In between suckling, look at your baby and try to gauge their comfort level. An uncomfortable grimace on your baby's otherwise pleasant lips may mean that she needs to burp loudly and grossly. If the baby relaxes her face again and seems content, the urge to burp has probably passed.[[Image:Burp Babies Step 14.jpg|center]]"
                ]
